# Findings of the scan of the image that are accepted.
#
# The format is the one of the ignore file of trivy, an entry is a finding
# that is not reported. An entry can have an expiry date, the finding is
# reported again when the date is reached.
#
# The image is built from the alpine release that is pinned in the
# Dockerfile, the scan of the operating system packages of the image is
# clean. The file is kept so that a finding that is accepted in the future
# has a place with a reason and an expiry date.
